   "confidence": "low",
   "notes": "14-17 Green St: post-war buff/gault brick three-storey range with decorative projecting-brick (dentil/stepped) panels beside the windows and a lead-capped projecting band over the shopfronts. White-framed metal casements, wide over the eastern unit. Ground floor: three dark shopfronts with gold lettering (Harriets Cafe Tearooms in the 2021 photo; OSM POIs now Cafe au Chocolat at 16-17 and Goldrush Vintage at 15). The eastern ~7 m (no. 14, Cloud & Co) is outside the photo and left unannotated. CC BY-SA 2.0 geograph photo."
